@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@username = alice
@password = replace-with-your-local-password

### OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### Register (201; 409 if username exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Login (REST Client can reference the named response below)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Create
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Explore Trexon.Web"}

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?completed=false&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Read
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Read the documentation","completed":true}

### Validation failure (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":""}

### Admin role (403 for a regular account)
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Cached public response
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/cached

### Structured 409
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/conflict

### Dependency health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Refresh (use the NEW refresh token returned here for the next refresh)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"}
